# sentence_id = 297
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = And if this is so, do you think it's fair, on your side, that you and we stand on equal terms as to justice, so that whatever treatment we undertake to give you, you think it right to do that back to us in return?
# literal_translation = And if this [is] so, do-you-think it-is from equal [footing] for-you both the just [thing] and for-us, and whatever-things we might undertake to-do to-you, these-things do-you-think [it-is] just to-do-in-return to-you?
