# sentence_id = 300
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = And will it then be possible for you to try to destroy your country and its laws too, while we try to destroy you, and will you consider that act just—will you, yes you, try to destroy us in return, us the laws and your country, insofar as you are able, and will you claim that in doing this you are acting justly, you who are truly concerned with virtue?
# literal_translation = And as for the fatherland too and the laws, then, will it be possible for you, so that, if we try to destroy you, considering [it] just [to do so], and you too, will you try to destroy us in return, the laws and the fatherland, insofar as you are able, and will you say that in doing these things you are doing just things, [you] the [one] in truth caring for virtue?
