# sentence_id = 310
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = And none of us laws stands in the way, nor forbids it, if anyone of you wishes to go into exile, in case we do not please him, both we and the city; and whether he wishes to go there to settle elsewhere, wherever he pleases, taking his own belongings with him.
# literal_translation = And no one of us, of the laws, is in-the-way, and does not forbid [it], if anyone of you wishes to go into a colony, if we do not please [him], both we and the city, and whether [he wishes] to settle-as-metic having gone elsewhere, whither he wishes, having his own things.
