# sentence_id = 319
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = So strongly did you choose us and agree to be a citizen under us, and you had your children in the city itself, because the city pleased you so much.
# literal_translation = So very much [you] chose us and agreed to be a citizen in accordance with us, and the other things, and [you] made children in it, on the grounds that the city was pleasing to you.
