# sentence_id = 320
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = Furthermore, even back then it was possible for you, in the course of your very trial, to propose exile as your penalty, if you had wanted to—and to do with the city's consent what you are now attempting to do without it.
# literal_translation = Still, then, in the very trial itself it was possible for you to assess [the penalty of] exile, if you were willing, and [to do] the very thing which now you are attempting [to do] against the city's will, then to do [it] with [the city's] willing [consent].
