# sentence_id = 322
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = Are you not ashamed of this, that now you don't feel shame before those arguments, and you don't show regard for us, the laws, while you try to destroy us, but you're doing the very things the lowest slave would do, trying to run away in violation of the compacts and agreements by which you agreed with us to be a citizen?
# literal_translation = Now but not are-you-not-able-to-be-ashamed-of those the arguments, and-not of-us of-the laws do-you-feel-respect, trying to-destroy [us], but you-are-doing the-very-things-which a-slave the most-base would-have-done, trying to-run-away contrary-to the compacts both and the agreements according-to which to-us you-agreed to-be-a-citizen.
